        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend&#10;Solid line = primary flow&#10;Dashed line = asynchronous / event-driven flow&#10;Red = blocked / missing / disabled&#10;🆕 = new in version N&#10;🔄 = changed in version N&#10;Outer boundary = stack Boundary (captioned; provider style)&#10;Numbered markers (1..N) = ordered data flow steps; see Flow list&#10;Syndicate Server (EC2) hosts Education Extension (lifecycle, see 05) + Syndi (support)&#10;Syndicate Server APIs: SS/EE Sandbox Access Management API; Syndicate Server Reporting API (emails + FreeMarker .ftl)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#B3B3B3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
